[I] A unit testing and mocking framework for C/C++

[T] CppUTest is a C/C++ based unit testing and mocking framework, designed
[T] with embedded software and test-driven development in mind. It provides
[T] test macros, memory leak detection and the CppUMock mocking support.

[U] https://cpputest.github.io/

